# Admin vs user UI

Same SPA. Auth is `_authenticated/route.tsx` (`beforeLoad` session). Admin is `_authenticated/admin/route.tsx` (non-admin → `/forbidden`).

| | Admin | User |
|---|--------|------|
| Path | `routes/_authenticated/admin/<resource>/` | `routes/_authenticated/<area>/<feature>/` |
| Example | `/admin/idioms` | `/game-assist/guess-idiom` |
| API | `lib/api/admin/admin-*-api.ts` | `lib/api/<feature>-api.ts` |
| Data | URL search + `usePaginatedQuery` | Local `useState` + mutations |
| Extra admin UI | Whole page is admin-only | `Route.useRouteContext().isAdmin` for optional actions |

## Admin list page (idioms)

Route file is the container: queries/mutations, toasts, `invalidate`. Children in `-components/` stay presentational (`onSubmit` only). Search schema in `-lib/` (`validateSearch`). Delete via shared `ConfirmDialog`. Pagination via `Pagination` + `usePaginatedQuery`.

## User feature page (guess-idiom)

Interactive tool, not a resource table. Keep game state local. Reuse an admin mutation only when the extra action is truly admin-only (e.g. quick-add idiom).

## Nav

Add entries in `routes/_authenticated/-lib/nav-items.ts`. Set `requiredRole` (a role string or list) on items that are not for every signed-in user. The sidebar filters by the current user's role; regular users see 概览, 开团, and 游戏辅助. Route access control is still `beforeLoad`. Do not add a second app or a public CRUD page.
